  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T03:11:36.808453Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-19T23:49:35.292636Z",
  "totalBlocks": 18,
  "translatedBlocks": 17,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c07c81b26b1263e",
      "translationZh": "我一直在 Omi 从事临床场景中的说话人归属识别工作，并想用同一份音频比较当前的说话人分离模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc0e04e4e9b25547",
      "translationZh": "我使用了 PriMock57 中的 15 段模拟医患问诊录音，总时长约 2.4 小时。使用完整录音，自动确定说话人数，不告诉模型有两个人。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c530a1b6e5e29acb",
      "translationZh": "说话人分离错误率（DER），边界容差为 ±250 ms。越低越好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6b1a1c3a428b8fc",
      "translationZh": "模型 DER 处理时间中位数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee976e20f4c2675a",
      "translationZh": "18.9 s / 每段录音（API）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "683a1a9028fb06ed",
      "translationZh": "本地模型在一块 NVIDIA L4 上运行。API 耗时包含往返开销；VibeVoice-ASR 还会执行转写。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e914a338ccba9095",
      "translationZh": "† 由于 Muse 每次请求有 10 分钟的时长限制，因此使用了 20 个独立片段，所以其结果并非基于完整录音的比较。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a36a6538a945c37f",
      "translationZh": "Pyannote Precision-3 的错误率最低。Nemotron 紧随其后，也是速度最快的本地模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0de6fcea516262d8",
      "translationZh": "† 原生流式预设通过不按实时节奏控制的完整文件回放进行评估。其他行使用按实时节奏交付的说话人输出。这些分数并不能确定实时延迟。我没有评估 Muse 的流式表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "de389bbf6f11b517",
      "translationZh": "相同权重，不同运行时",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a40c433139a7fb7d",
      "translationZh": "我还尝试使用我们的专有运行时优化 Nemotron 和 Community-1，而不改变权重：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5f38aaf616b70733",
      "translationZh": "Nemotron：DER 从 4.803% → 3.174%。错误率降低 34%，速度提升至 2.13×。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d9d41ac190b7710b",
      "translationZh": "Community-1：DER 从 6.620% → 5.435%。错误率降低 18%，速度提升至 24×。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88d0599a30025634",
      "translationZh": "在边界容忍度为零时，Nemotron 使用该运行时的结果略有变差：12.720% → 13.203%。两个分数均已公布。这是一个小型数据集，其参考标注经过 VAD 精修，而且我们是在这个数据集上开发运行时设置的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04f466c609f9ff2e",
      "translationZh": "音频、参考标注、评分工具、保存的输出以及 NVIDIA 基线运行程序均已公开。我们的运行时代码仍不公开，但其输出已包含在内，可供重新评分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5cbd2c419070403",
      "translationZh": "代码仓库和详细介绍在评论里。还有其他值得加入的说话人分离模型吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c60d8477abbcb49",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/MajesticAd2862 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
